    -- 3. newsletter-editorial-masthead
    (NULL, 'newsletter-editorial-masthead',
     'Editorial Masthead Essay',
     'Unbundled inbox-native essay newsletter with mixed-case display masthead, read-time pill, one fully-argued idea, and reply-as-CTA. No ''also in this issue'' sections.',
     'marketing',
     'the post i almost didn''t send',
     'On the thing nobody in our space wants to admit out loud.',
     '<div style="background-color:#F7F3EC;padding:32px 16px;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;">'
     || '<table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#FFFCF6;">'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:36px 44px 0 44px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td align="left" style="font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:22px;line-height:26px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#1B1B1B;font-weight:400;">Postwave <span style="color:#6B5F4A;">/</span> Dispatch</td><td align="right" style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:26px;color:#6B5F4A;letter-spacing:0.08em;">Issue No. {{issue_number}}</td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:14px 44px 0 44px;"><div style="border-top:1px solid #E4DCC8;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:22px 44px 0 44px;" align="left"><span style="display:inline-block;border:1px solid #C9BFA8;color:#6B5F4A;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">&#9711; {{read_time}} read</span></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:24px 44px 0 44px;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:34px;line-height:40px;color:#1B1B1B;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">{{essay_title}}</td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:18px 44px 0 44px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#A89B7C;letter-spacing:0.18em;">&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash; THE COLD OPEN</td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:14px 44px 0 44px;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;color:#1B1B1B;">{{cold_open}}</td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:28px 44px 0 44px;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#1B1B1B;">There''s a post I almost didn''t send. It sat in my drafts for nine days. I rewrote the opening eleven times. I asked a friend to read it. She said the quiet part too loud: <em>you''re going to publish this anyway, so stop pretending you''re deciding.</em><br><br>She was right. Most of the things we agonize over sending aren''t really about the writing. They''re about the small, embarrassing risk of being slightly more honest in public than we usually are. The risk of someone reading the line we underlined for ourselves and seeing the version of us that wrote it.</td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:24px 44px 0 44px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#FBF1E6;border-left:4px solid #C2410C;"><tr><td style="padding:18px 22px;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;color:#1B1B1B;">&ldquo;{{pull_quote}}&rdquo;</td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:24px 44px 0 44px;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#1B1B1B;">The thing nobody in our space wants to admit out loud is that the polish is mostly a stalling tactic. The third edit isn''t sharpening the argument; it''s softening it. By the seventh, the post is shaped like everyone else''s. By the ninth, it''s safe enough that no one will remember reading it.<br><br>I''m not interested in writing the safe version anymore. I don''t think you are either &mdash; otherwise you wouldn''t be on a list called Dispatch, reading a 400-word essay on a Tuesday morning instead of the news. So here''s the compromise I''ve made with myself, and it''s the only editorial rule I follow now: <strong style="font-weight:600;">if it scares me a little to press send, it''s probably the right one.</strong><br><br>This was one of those.</td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:30px 44px 0 44px;" align="center"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:13px;color:#C9BFA8;letter-spacing:0.4em;">&#9642; &nbsp; &#9642; &nbsp; &#9642;</span></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:24px 44px 0 44px;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#1B1B1B;" align="left">I''d love to know which side of the draft folder you''re on this week &mdash; the one you almost didn''t send, or the one you wish you had.<br><br><a href="mailto:{{reply_email}}" style="font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#C2410C;text-decoration:underline;">Reply with your take &rarr;</a></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:36px 44px 0 44px;"><div style="border-top:1px solid #E4DCC8;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:18px 44px 0 44px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td align="left" style="font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#1B1B1B;"><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6B5F4A;">Written by</span><br><strong style="font-weight:600;">{{author_name}}</strong></td><td align="right" style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#6B5F4A;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;">Postwave<br>Dispatch &middot; No. {{issue_number}}</td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:28px 44px 36px 44px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#A89B7C;letter-spacing:0.06em;" align="center">You''re reading because you asked to. <a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" style="color:#6B5F4A;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a> any time &mdash; no hard feelings, no follow-up sequence.</td></tr>'
     || '</table></div>',
     '[{"name":"issue_number","label":"Issue #","default":"Issue 014"},{"name":"read_time","label":"Read time","default":"4 min read"},{"name":"essay_title","label":"Essay title","default":"The post I almost didn''t send"},{"name":"cold_open","label":"Cold open","default":"I''ve been wrong about open rates for two years."},{"name":"pull_quote","label":"Pull-quote","default":"The metric we optimized made the product worse."},{"name":"author_name","label":"Author","default":"Harsh"},{"name":"reply_email","label":"Reply-to","default":"dispatch@postwave.com"},{"name":"unsubscribe_url","label":"Unsubscribe URL","default":"https://postwave.com/unsubscribe"}]'::jsonb,
     ARRAY['newsletter','editorial','essay','long-form','lowercase'],
     'newsletter',
     true),

    -- 4. newsletter-card-grid-digest
    (NULL, 'newsletter-card-grid-digest',
     'Card-Grid Story Digest',
     'Morning-Brew-style scannable digest: 3 modular story cards stacked vertically, each with eyebrow, title, one-line summary, and inline link. No images, no hairlines.',
     'marketing',
     '5 things I''m watching this week (#3 is wild)',
     'The shortlist: deliverability, AMP, sender rep, BIMI, and one I can''t believe.',
     '<table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background-color:#F4F4F5;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;">'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:32px 24px 8px 24px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A;">THIS WEEK&nbsp;&nbsp;/&nbsp;&nbsp;{{issue_date}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:10px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">5 things I&rsquo;m watching this week</td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:6px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#52525B;">The shortlist: deliverability, AMP, sender rep, BIMI, and one I can&rsquo;t believe.</td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:24px 24px 0 24px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:14px;"><tr><td style="padding:22px 24px 22px 24px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0EA5E9;font-weight:600;">{{card_one_eyebrow}}</div><div style="padding-top:10px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">{{card_one_title}}</div><div style="padding-top:8px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#52525B;">Gmail and Yahoo quietly raised the bar again. The new spam thresholds mean even a 0.2% complaint rate can throttle delivery on big lists.</div><div style="padding-top:14px;"><a href="#" style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0EA5E9;text-decoration:underline;">Read it &rarr;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:16px 24px 0 24px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:14px;"><tr><td style="padding:22px 24px 22px 24px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A855F7;font-weight:600;">TOOLING</div><div style="padding-top:10px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">AMP for Email is having a quiet renaissance</div><div style="padding-top:8px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#52525B;">Three ESPs shipped first-class AMP support this month. Inline forms, live carousels, dynamic pricing &mdash; without leaving the inbox.</div><div style="padding-top:14px;"><a href="#" style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#A855F7;text-decoration:underline;">Read it &rarr;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:16px 24px 0 24px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:14px;"><tr><td style="padding:22px 24px 22px 24px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F97316;font-weight:600;">OPINION&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;#3</div><div style="padding-top:10px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">BIMI is a marketing channel now, and nobody told the marketers</div><div style="padding-top:8px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#52525B;">The logo-in-the-inbox spec was meant to fight spoofing. It&rsquo;s quietly become the most valuable 32x32 pixels in marketing. This is the wild one.</div><div style="padding-top:14px;"><a href="#" style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#F97316;text-decoration:underline;">Read it &rarr;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:28px 24px 12px 24px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#A1A1AA;">&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:4px 24px 32px 24px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#71717A;">You&rsquo;re reading issue {{issue_date}} of the digest. Missed a week? <a href="{{archive_url}}" style="color:#18181B;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:600;">Browse the archive &rarr;</a></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:10px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:#A1A1AA;">Sent with care &middot; <a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" style="color:#71717A;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '</table>',
     '[{"name":"issue_date","label":"Issue date","default":"May 28"},{"name":"card_one_eyebrow","label":"Card 1 category","default":"DELIVERABILITY"},{"name":"card_one_title","label":"Card 1 title","default":"Gmail''s new spam threshold is biting"},{"name":"archive_url","label":"Archive URL","default":"https://postwave.com/archive"},{"name":"unsubscribe_url","label":"Unsubscribe URL","default":"https://postwave.com/unsubscribe"}]'::jsonb,
     ARRAY['newsletter','digest','card-grid','scannable','weekly'],
     'newsletter',
     false),

    -- 5. announcement-we-didnt-ship
    (NULL, 'announcement-we-didnt-ship',
     'We Didn''t Ship This',
     'Linear/Figma-style honesty post announcing what was CUT from a release and why. Builds trust, creates anticipation, doubles as a roadmap signal.',
     'marketing',
     'We rebuilt {{feature}}. Here''s what we cut.',
     'Three things didn''t make it. We''ll tell you exactly why.',
     '<div style="background-color:#FAFAFA;padding:40px 20px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;">'
     || '<table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E5E5E5;border-radius:12px;">'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:48px 48px 16px 48px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#737373;font-weight:600;">RELEASE&nbsp;&nbsp;{{version}}</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:8px 48px 24px 48px;"><h1 style="margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:42px;line-height:46px;color:#0A0A0A;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">We rebuilt {{feature}}.</h1></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 32px 48px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;color:#A3A3A3;letter-spacing:0.05em;">───────────────────────────────────</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 16px 48px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0A0A0A;font-weight:700;">TL;DR&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;WHAT SHIPPED</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 40px 48px;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#262626;">{{feature}} is faster, calmer, and does less. We threw away the parts that nobody used and rebuilt the parts that everyone fought with. It now loads in under a second and stays out of your way until you need it.</p></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 24px 48px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;">▌ WHAT WE CUT</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 8px 48px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"><tr><td valign="top" width="40" style="width:40px;padding:4px 0 0 0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#A3A3A3;font-weight:600;">01</td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 20px 0;"><div style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;color:#737373;text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:500;">{{cut_item_one}}</div><p style="margin:6px 0 0 0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#404040;">It looked clever in a demo and nobody touched it in production. We measured six months of usage and the answer was honest enough to act on.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="padding:0 0 4px 0;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;color:#E5E5E5;letter-spacing:0.05em;">·······································</div></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" width="40" style="width:40px;padding:4px 0 0 0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#A3A3A3;font-weight:600;">02</td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 20px 0;"><div style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;color:#737373;text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:500;">The settings panel inside the settings panel</div><p style="margin:6px 0 0 0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#404040;">Two levels of nesting was one too many and we knew it. The five options that mattered are now in plain view. The rest are gone.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="padding:0 0 4px 0;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;color:#E5E5E5;letter-spacing:0.05em;">·······································</div></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" width="40" style="width:40px;padding:4px 0 0 0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#A3A3A3;font-weight:600;">03</td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 8px 0;"><div style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;color:#737373;text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:500;">The onboarding tour with seven tooltips</div><p style="margin:6px 0 0 0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#404040;">If the product needs seven tooltips to explain itself, the product is the problem. We rewrote the interface instead of the explanation.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:24px 48px 8px 48px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;color:#A3A3A3;letter-spacing:0.05em;">───────────────────────────────────</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td align="left" style="padding:24px 48px 12px 48px;"><a href="{{cta_url}}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#0A0A0A;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:0.01em;">Try {{feature}} &rarr;</a></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 40px 48px;"><a href="{{changelog_url}}" style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#737373;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">Read the full changelog</a></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 16px 48px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;color:#E5E5E5;letter-spacing:0.05em;">▌▌▌</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 48px 48px 48px;"><p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;font-family:''Caveat'',Georgia,serif;font-size:24px;line-height:28px;color:#0A0A0A;font-style:italic;">— the team</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#737373;">Built with fewer features. On purpose.</p></td></tr>'
     || '</table>'
     || '<table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;margin:24px auto 0 auto;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:16px 48px;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#A3A3A3;letter-spacing:0.05em;">You''re getting release notes because you use Postwave.<br/><a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" style="color:#737373;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="{{changelog_url}}" style="color:#737373;text-decoration:underline;">All releases</a></p></td></tr></table></div>',
     '[{"name":"version","label":"Version","default":"2026.6"},{"name":"feature","label":"Feature","default":"the audience segment builder"},{"name":"cut_item_one","label":"First cut","default":"Bulk re-segment on import"},{"name":"cta_url","label":"Try-it URL","default":"https://app.postwave.com/segments"},{"name":"changelog_url","label":"Changelog URL","default":"https://postwave.com/changelog"},{"name":"unsubscribe_url","label":"Unsubscribe URL","default":"https://postwave.com/unsubscribe"}]'::jsonb,
     ARRAY['announcement','transparency','release-notes','engineering-voice'],
     'announcement',
     true),

    -- 6. announcement-milestone-typographic
    (NULL, 'announcement-milestone-typographic',
     'Milestone Number Hero',
     'Typographic milestone announcement (10K customers, 1B emails, Series A) where a single giant number IS the hero. No image, no chart — just a 96px numeral as the brand moment.',
     'marketing',
     '{{milestone_number}}',
     'A number, a thank-you, and one thing we''re doing about it.',
     '<table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#FAF9F6;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;">'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:32px 24px 16px 24px;text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#8B7E68;text-transform:uppercase;">─── a small note from the team ───</div></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:0 24px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#F5E6D3;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#FDF4E3,#F5E6D3);border-radius:8px;"><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" style="height:200px;padding:40px 24px;text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:96px;line-height:100px;color:#1A1A1A;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.04em;">{{milestone_number}}</div><div style="margin-top:16px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#6B5F4A;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;">{{milestone_label}}</div></td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:24px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #EFE6D5;"><tr><td style="padding:32px;"><p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#1A1A1A;">When we started, we weren''t sure anyone would notice. Today there are {{milestone_number}} of you — and that still doesn''t feel real. So before anything else, thank you. Genuinely.</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#1A1A1A;">A few weeks ago {{customer_name}} sent us a note that''s been pinned to the wall ever since. It''s the kind of thing that decides what we work on next.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 20px;border-left:3px solid #C9A87A;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;color:#4A3F2E;">— {{customer_quote}}</p><p style="margin:12px 0 0 0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B7E68;text-transform:uppercase;">{{customer_name}}</p></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 28px 0;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#1A1A1A;">Here''s what we''re doing about it: we''re spending the next quarter on the unglamorous things — the small frictions, the rough edges, the second-clicks that should be first-clicks. No new logos. Just better work for the people already here.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin:0 auto;"><tr><td align="center" style="background-color:#1A1A1A;border-radius:999px;"><a href="{{cta_url}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:16px 32px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FAF9F6;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.02em;">Reply or share the news →</a></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:36px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #EFE6D5;"><p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;color:#4A3F2E;">With gratitude,</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:Georgia,''Times New Roman'',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;line-height:28px;color:#1A1A1A;">{{founder_name}}</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B7E68;text-transform:uppercase;">Founder</p></div></td></tr></table></td></tr>'
     || '<tr><td style="padding:8px 24px 32px 24px;text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#8B7E68;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;">▌▌▌</div><p style="margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#8B7E68;">You''re getting this because you''re one of the {{milestone_number}}.<br><a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" style="color:#6B5F4A;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr>'
     || '</table>',
